# TdpGis.Api Clean Architecture

```text
Endpoint → UseCase → Ports → Infrastructure adapters
```

## Do

- Put orchestration in `TdpGis.Application/UseCases/...`
- Fail with `GisQueryFailureKind` + messages helper
- Map HTTP in `TdpGis.Api` via `GisQueryHttp`
- Validate workspace tokens in `WorkspaceAccessGuard`
- Keep FastEndpoints as HTTP adapters only

## Don't

- Put `400`/`401`/`404` literals in Application use cases
- Call `IGisConfigurationService` / `IGisDataService` business sequences from endpoints (call the use case)
- Reintroduce `GisWorkspaceAccess.TryValidateAsync` business logic in Api
